WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.985
Welcome to Mutable Dreams. two point four.

00:00:06.025 --> 00:00:14.389
A small instrument. with six freely
assignable tracks… and more room to explore.

00:00:14.429 --> 00:00:17.621
Take a moment. and listen.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.943
Twelve new Tones.

00:00:32.983 --> 00:00:34.925
Twenty new Biomes.

00:00:34.965 --> 00:00:40.212
Warm pads. rounded basses and softly bowed
strings.

00:00:40.252 --> 00:00:48.143
Keep your notes and rhythm… and give each
track a different voice.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:24.899
Eleven additional Dreams open new paths
through the garden.

00:02:24.939 --> 00:02:32.157
Choose a code. or build My Dream from your
favourite Biomes.

00:02:32.197 --> 00:02:34.796
Let the music unfold.

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:21.448
Add a little air.

00:03:21.488 --> 00:03:23.314
A gentle chorus.

00:03:23.354 --> 00:03:28.289
Wider space. or a touch of vintage drift.

00:03:28.329 --> 00:03:33.265
These are optional colours. made inside the
FM1.

00:03:33.305 --> 00:03:36.375
Listen to the same phrase.

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:34.422
Both LFOs can now move Grain Size and
Position.

00:04:34.462 --> 00:04:41.705
New grains follow the movement… while grains
already playing keep their shape.

00:04:41.745 --> 00:04:46.561
Slow changes can open a whole new landscape.

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:48.565
Load a saved User Biome while keeping your
MIDI setup.

00:05:48.605 --> 00:05:54.170
Move backwards or forwards with Select and
the octave buttons.

00:05:54.210 --> 00:05:59.214
Hold a function button… and its help is
there.

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:34.811
Under the surface. both cores share real
audio work.

00:06:34.851 --> 00:06:38.712
Engine states now share memory too.

00:06:38.752 --> 00:06:47.815
All six tracks and twenty-four models remain
available. with more space for what comes

00:06:47.855 --> 00:06:48.465
next.

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:00.821
Find sounds faster.

00:07:00.861 --> 00:07:08.265
Explore Grids rhythms. very slow tempos.
night mode and a sleep timer.

00:07:08.305 --> 00:07:16.329
Biome handovers are more robust. and the
help follows what you are doing.

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:39.943
Mutable Dreams. by Kid Bunka.

00:07:39.983 --> 00:07:46.505
Back up your own Biomes before updating. and
read the guide.

00:07:46.545 --> 00:07:50.085
Then come back to the music.

00:07:50.125 --> 00:07:52.471
Thank you for listening.
